  to. Purpose: "represent a common table expression as a table."
- trueqbit (11 a, 14): "base table" becomes SQLite's "ordinary table"
  (lang_createtable.html): base_table -> ordinary_table and its traits,
  table.h -> ordinary_table.h, table_definitions.h ->
  ordinary_table_definitions.h; table_identifier.h and table_base.h keep
  "table" in the wide sense; make_table() stays. "Base table" also
  collided with table_base.h, a C++ base class.
